[h1]Yang Guang: Four Seas[/h1]
[b]Independent new leader · Preview 0.1.0 · Single-player · Not verified in-game[/b]

Adds a separate Chinese leader; original Yang Guang is unchanged. Requires Gathering Storm, HD, Phantagonist Yang Guang, Chinese Dynasty Uniques and Rulers of the Sahara.
Retains capital population/granary, relocation, Sui trade, Fubing and Xiaoguo. No population rush or Canglin access. Adds Qin construction bonuses/Great Wall and installed HD Kublai/Ptolemaic Cleopatra traits. Foreign incoming land/sea routes grant the destination +2 Gold/+1 Culture. No Qin leader trait, Retainers or Ruishi.
Medieval Wuya Warship replaces Frigate at Mercenaries, inheriting current Frigate stats/costs/resources/upgrades. +5 Strength on Coast or within 2 tiles of a completed friendly Canal, non-stacking. Protects friendly Traders within 4 tiles.
Preview references original Yang Guang portrait and existing Frigate art/icons; no third-party assets bundled. New code/cover MIT. Referenced content retains its original rights.
New game required. Art, diplomacy, route yields, HD events and saves need real-game verification.
